# Links on yellow / accent cards

On **yellow-tint or accent cards** (`bg-card-light`, `bg-accent`, `rgb(237 217 116 / 50%)`), including when those cards sit on a **grey (`#FAFAFA`)** section:

- Link color is **`text-heading` (`#222`)** — or `text-card-link-light`, which maps to the same token
- Use `ServiceCard variant="light"` (it already uses `text-card-link-light`)
- Handmade links: `text-heading font-medium text-[14px] md:text-[15px] hover:underline`

Do **not** use `text-primary` or `text-accent` / gold on these cards. Both sit too close to the yellow wash and the link disappears.

Black cards on grey still use gold links (`text-accent` / `text-card-link-dark`). This rule is only for yellow cards.
